# Recovery starts watchdogd from the rootfs-labelled recovery ramdisk (init.recovery.r1.rc),
# like the services AOSP lists in init.te; without this the exec is denied and the boot
# deadman resets recovery after watchdog.open_timeout.
recovery_only(`
  domain_trans(init, rootfs, watchdogd)
  allow watchdogd rootfs:dir r_dir_perms;
')
